@startuml sequence_diagram
' ROS 2 sequence diagram: /target_pose → /joint_states поток
' Показывает полный путь от пользовательского ввода до публикации углов суставов

actor User
participant "teleop_keyboard.py\nили run_drift_tests.py" as Input
participant "/target_pose\nPoseStamped" as TargetPose
participant "so101_ik_node" as IKNode
participant "/joint_states\nJointState" as JointStates
participant "robot_state_publisher" as RSPub
participant "/tf\nTFMessage" as TF
participant "RViz2" as RViz

User -> Input : нажимает клавишу (T/G/...) или генерирует PoseStamped
Input -> TargetPose : публикует target PoseStamped
TargetPose -> IKNode : callback (50 Гц polling)

activate IKNode
IKNode -> IKNode : forwardKinematics(q) → ee_pos, ee_rot
IKNode -> IKNode : computeJacobian(q) → J
IKNode -> IKNode : runIKLoop:
  1. err = [target_pos - ee_pos; log(R_target · ee_rotᵀ)]
  2. если ‖err‖ < eps → converged
  3. иначе: v_task = J^T·W·(W·JJ^T·W + λ²I)⁻¹·W·e
  4. N = I - J^+·J
  5. z = sum_null_space_attractors (jc, prev, pref, man, drift, coll)
  6. q += dt·(v_task + N·z)
  7. clamp velocity, apply CBF bounds, clip position
  8. если stuck → multistart perturb (5 попыток)
IKNode -> IKNode : computeCollisionMarkers
deactivate IKNode

IKNode -> JointStates : publish JointState (50 Гц)
IKNode -> TargetPose : publish target_marker (vis_msgs/Marker)
IKNode -> TargetPose : publish ee_pose (PoseStamped)
IKNode -> TargetPose : publish collision_marker (vis_msgs/Marker)

JointStates -> RSPub : подписка
RSPub -> RSPub : read URDF, compute FK по chain
RSPub -> TF : publish tf2_msgs/TFMessage (100 Гц)

TF -> RViz : TF buffer update
JointStates -> RViz : прямой subscriber для JointState (через TF)
TargetPose -> RViz : markers (через TF)

@enduml
